Z||000001||batboy||07-29-2000||12:53 AM||||I personally don't know why anyone would spend that much money for a stock engine. Heck, I've only got about 4 grand into my V8 Fiero...TOTAL. That includes complete suspension rebuild and upgraded brakes. I'm building an 88 Z-28 roller 350 for about $2500 that will whip that LS1 crate motor's hinny up one side and down the other. With aluminum heads, aluminum intake manifold, headers, and moving the battery up front, I bet my future setup is not a whole heck of a lot more weight either, relatively speaking. Some of you apparently have more money than sense. I wish I did too...LOL.||||reg||1
